do_2 = "Port sim_env and core_sim_test: SimulatedStorage with FaultPlan maximum_write_bytes, torn_after_bytes, kill_after_durable_lsn, reverse_write_completion, fsync_lies; 2,048 randomised schedules converge to one CanonicalBytes; kill at every LSN; writer-ownership violation; real fork plus SIGKILL after commit."

